# Full Stack Blog Post Web App

A simple full-stack blog application built using frontend and backend technologies, running on a local server. Users can create, view, edit, and delete blog posts.

## Features
- CRUD operations for blog posts
- RESTful API
- Local server setup

## Tech Stack
- Frontend: HTML, CSS, JavaScript
- Backend: Node.js, Express.js
- Database: MongoDB / Local storage

## Run Locally
```bash
npm install
npm start
